<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_3_2_4" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-03">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_3_2_4">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_3_2_4" name="3.2.4 Lead Flotation Circuit" processRef="Process_L3_3_2_4"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_3_2_4" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>[LEAD-SPECIFIC — where applicable] Applies to: Antamina (where Pb circuit is activated), Red Dog. L0/L1/L2 Process. At polymetallic operations with galena (PbS), a lead flotation circuit follows the Zn circuit (or in some designs, precedes it in a Cu-Pb-Zn sequential circuit). At Red Dog, Pb and Zn are separated by differential flotation — Pb is floated first at low pH (Pb selectivity over sphalerite), then Zn is activated and floated.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_3_2_4">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_3_2_4_ops" name="Control Room Operator / Metallurgist / DCS">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_3_2_4_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_3_2_4_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_3_2_4_s" name="Zn tailings or mill product available">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_2_4_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_1" name="3.2.4.1 Operate Pb Rougher Flotation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pb rougher floats galena from the circuit feed. At Red Dog, differential flotation targets Pb first — pH is maintained at 7–8 to naturally depress sphalerite while galena floats. At Antamina, Pb is recovered from Zn circuit tailings using xanthate collectors. On-stream analysis measures Pb%, Zn%, and Ag% in rougher concentrate. [P754: grade (Pb%, Zn%, Ag g/t) | on-stream XRF | continuous (2–4 min) | Principles 1, 2, 6, 7 | NO]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 2
Actors: (not stated in decomposition)
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 2; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 2, 6, 7
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_2_4_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_2_4_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_3" name="3.2.4.3 Operate Pb Regrind Mill">
      <bpmn:documentation>Where required for improved liberation, Pb rougher concentrate is reground before cleaning. [LEAD NOTE: More common at Red Dog where ore mineralogy requires it.]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 2
Actors: (not stated in decomposition)
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 2
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_2_4_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_2_4_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_2" name="3.2.4.2 Operate Pb Cleaner Flotation">
      <bpmn:documentation>Pb cleaner(s) upgrade rougher concentrate to final Pb concentrate grade (typically 60–65% Pb, high Ag credit). Final Pb cleaner concentrate is the Pb product — its mass and grade are custody transfer points to Pb thickening. Shift composite sample collected. [P754: grade (Pb%, Zn%, Ag g/t, Au g/t) + mass flow | on-stream XRF + shift composite | continuous OSA + shift | Principles 1, 2, 5, 6, 7 | YES — Pb cleaner final concentrate is a custody transfer point]
ISA-95 level: 0 / 2
Actors: (not stated in decomposition)
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Levels 0, 2; AMIRA P754 Principles 1, 2, 5, 6, 7
DDVC layer: Raw; Curated (concentrate_production_record — Pb)</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_2_4_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_3_2_4_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_3_2_4_e" name="Pb concentrate to thickening">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_3_2_4_4</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_2_4_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_3_2_4_s" targetRef="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_2_4_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_1" targetRef="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_2_4_3" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_3" targetRef="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_3_2_4_4" sourceRef="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_2" targetRef="End_L3_3_2_4_e"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_3_2_4">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_3_2_4" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_3_2_4">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_3_2_4_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_3_2_4" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="916" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_3_2_4_ops_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_3_2_4_ops" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="876" height="170"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_3_2_4_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_3_2_4_s"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="88" y="139" width="100" height="56"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_1_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_1"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_3_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_3"><dc:Bounds x="408" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_3_2_4_3_2_4_2"><dc:Bounds x="614" y="65" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_3_2_4_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_3_2_4_e"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="77" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="798" y="139" width="100" height="56"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_2_4_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_2_4_1"><di:waypoint x="166" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_2_4_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_2_4_2"><di:waypoint x="372" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="408" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_2_4_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_2_4_3"><di:waypoint x="578" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="614" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_3_2_4_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_3_2_4_4"><di:waypoint x="784" y="105"/><di:waypoint x="820" y="105"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
